	 kb:description="The date must be expressed in either the YYYY-MM-DD or the YYYY-DOY format where YYYY is the 4-digit year (-9999 to 9999), MM is the 2-digit month (01-12), DD is the 2-digit day-of-month (01-31), and DOY is the 3-digit day-of-year (001-366)"
