<kb:ValueMeaning rdf:about="&pdsns;VM.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.ASCII_Date_Time_YMD.pds.formation_rule_1156197148"
	 kb:beginDate="TBD_value_begin_date"
	 kb:description="YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.SSSSSS(Z) - The date must be expressed in the YYYY-MM-DD format where YYYY is the 4-digit year (-9999 to 9999), MM is the 2-digit month-of-year (01-12), DD is the 2-digit day-of-month, and DOY is the 3-digit day-of-year (001-366). &quot;T&quot; is a delimiter separating date and time. Time must be expressed in the HH:MM:SS.SSSSSS(Z) format where HH is the 2-digit hour (00-23), MM is the 2-digit minute (00-59), SS is the 2-digit integer second (00-60), SSSSSS is microseconds (000000-999999), and &quot;(Z)&quot; indicates that &quot;Z&quot; may be optionally appended to denote UTC."
	 kb:endDate="TBD_value_end_date"
	 rdfs:label="VM.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.ASCII_Date_Time_YMD.pds.formation_rule_1156197148"/>
 
