	 kb:beginDate="TBD_value_begin_date"
	 kb:description="The path name to the directory must be given as the sequence of directories traversed between the current working directory and the target directory where each directory name is followed by the forward slash character (&quot;/&quot;). See the PDS4 Standards Reference section &quot;File and Directory Naming&quot; for rules on forming directory names."
