	 kb:beginDate="TBD_value_begin_date"
	 kb:description="A balloon-borne observatory, typically consisting of a gondola structure carrying one or more telescopes and instruments, borne aloft by an unpowered or minimially powered lighter-than-atmosphere balloon for a limited observing period."
