	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Data_Set_PDS3.pds.data_set_name">
	<kb:definitionText>The data_set_name attribute provides the full name given to a data set or a data product. The data_set_name typically identifies the instrument that acquired the data of that instrument Example value data_set_id. Note This attribute is defined in the AMMOS Magellan catalog as an alias for file_name to provide backward compatibility</kb:definitionText>
