<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Data_Set_PDS3.pds.data_set_release_date"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Data_Set_PDS3.pds.data_set_release_date">
	<kb:definitionText>The data_set_release_date attribute provides the date when a data set is released by the data producer for archive or publication. In many systems this represents the end of a proprietary or validation period. Formation rule In AMMOS identify the date at which a product may be released to the general public from proprietary access. AMMOS-related systems should apply this attribute only to proprietary data.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
