	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Field_Bit.pds.stop_bit">
	<kb:definitionText>The stop-bit attribute provides the location of the last bit in this bit field relative to the first bit in the packed_data field.  Bits are numbered continuously across byte boundaries.  The first bit location in the packed data field is &quot;1&quot;.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
