	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Field_Character.pds.validation_format">
	<kb:definitionText>The validation_format attribute gives the magnitude and precision of the data value with the expectation that both will be validated exactly. A subset of the standard POSIX string formats is allowed. See the PDS Standards Reference section &quot;Field Formats&quot; for details.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
