<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Field_Character.pds.value_offset"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Field_Character.pds.value_offset">
	<kb:definitionText>The value_offset attribute is the offset to be applied to each stored value in order to recover an original  value. The observed value (Ov) is calculated from the stored value (Sv) thus: Ov = (Sv * scaling_factor) + value_offset. The default value is 0.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
