	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Group.pds.groups">
	<kb:definitionText>The groups attribute provides a count of the number of (sub)groups within the repeating structure of a group.  (Subsub)groups within (sub)groups within the group are not included in this count.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
