<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Group_Field_Binary.pds.group_length"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Group_Field_Binary.pds.group_length">
	<kb:definitionText>The group_length attribute provides the total length, in bytes, of a repeating field and/or group structure. It is the number of bytes in the repeating fields/groups plus any embedded unused bytes that are also repeated multiplied by the number of repetitions.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
