	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Group_Field_Character.pds.group_location">
	<kb:definitionText>The group_location attribute provides the starting position for a Group_Field_Character within the containing Record_Character or Group_Field_Character class, in bytes. Location &apos;1&apos; denotes the first byte of the containing class.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
