<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Instrument_Host.pds.type"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Instrument_Host.pds.type">
	<kb:definitionText>The type attribute classifies the instrument host.  When more than one value is correct, the value with the finest granularity should be selected.  That is, choose &quot;rover&quot; rather than &quot;spacecraft&quot; when both would be correct since rover more narrowly defines the type of instrument host.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
