<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Mission_Phase.pds.release_number"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Mission_Phase.pds.release_number">
	<kb:definitionText>The release_number attribute is the number of a scheduled release of data from the provider to PDS. The first data release is typically Release 1. The release_number for a given product is always the first release in which it appears, and does not change if the product is revised later.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
