<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Organization.pds.organization_rorid"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Organization.pds.organization_rorid">
	<kb:definitionText>The organization_rorid attribute provides the Research Organization Registry ID that reliably, unambiguously, and permanently connects the organization’s name with its citable research, publications, grants, and other information. The RORID is expressed as a fully formed URI (e.g., https://ror.org/027k65916).</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
