<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.PDS_Guest.pds.electronic_mail_address"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.PDS_Guest.pds.electronic_mail_address">
	<kb:definitionText>The electronic mail address attribute provides a multi-part email address: the first part (the user name), which identifies a unique user, is separated by an &quot;at sign&quot;  from the host name, which uniquely identifies the mail server.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
