	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Special_Constants.pds.low_instrument_saturation">
	<kb:definitionText>The low_instrument_saturation attribute specifies a special value whose presence indicates the measuring instrument was saturated at the low end. The value must be less than the value of the valid_minimum attribute. Values of this attribute should be represented in the same data_type as the elements in the object with which the Special_Constants class is associated.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
