<kb:Definition rdf:about="&pdsns;DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Time_Coordinates.pds.local_true_solar_time"
	 kb:isPreferred="TRUE"
	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Time_Coordinates.pds.local_true_solar_time">
	<kb:definitionText>The local_true_solar_time (LTST) attribute provides the local time on a rotating solar system body where LTST is 12 h at the sub-solar point (SSP) and increases 1 h for each 15 degree increase in east longitude away from the SSP for prograde rotation.</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
