	 rdfs:label="DEF.0001_NASA_PDS_1.pds.Volume_Set_PDS3.pds.volume_set_id">
	<kb:definitionText>The volume_set_id attribute identifies a data volume or a set of volumes. Volume sets are normally considered as a single orderable entity. Examples: USA_NASA_PDS_MG_1001, USA_NASA_PDS_GR_0001_TO_GR_0009</kb:definitionText>
</kb:Definition>
 
